    "If some goods may be left unshipped, is the objective still to minimize containers (and if so, is there any penalty or preference for shipping as much as possible), or must every available unit of every type be shipped?",
    "Is there any penalty or preference for shipping as much as possible?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response contains a primary question about the objective (minimize containers vs. ship all) and a distinct sub-question about penalties/preferences for shipping volume, which can be answered independently."
}

